00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,432
Exam tip.

2
00:00:01,432 --> 00:00:10,455
A four mark disease question wants four facts: the pathogen, how it spreads, two or three symptoms, and one control measure.

3
00:00:10,455 --> 00:00:17,252
And write the scientific name correctly: capital genus, small species, Plasmodium vivax.

